::::
:::

- @Key idea@: Git versions the code and `changelog.txt` versions the container,
  so a commit always names the environment that can run it

// TODO(gp): Look into Skopeo for registry-to-registry image copy, cosign for
//   image signing, and Syft/Grype for an SBOM plus vulnerability check at
